/**
\mainpage flowfwd

`flowfwd` is a DPDK packet forwarder: it receives packets on one interface, forwards them to another, and keeps
per-flow (5-tuple) statistics that it exports to one CSV file per worker core.

Start here:

- \subpage md_README "README" (how to build, run, configure and verify the program, with the export format and the
  design decisions and limitations)
- \subpage architecture "How flowfwd works, unit by unit" (the life of a packet in both directions, and the
  purpose of every function)

The reference of every file, structure and function follows from the "Files" and "Data Structures" entries in the
menu.
*/
